<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<pipeline>
  <info>
    <name>staatskanzlei.wahlresultate</name>
    <description>eCH-0252 v1: eidgenoessische und kantonale Geschaefte, eine Zeile pro Geschaeftskomponente und Gemeinde; ausschliesslich Standard-Transforms.</description>
    <parameters>
      <parameter>
        <name>INPUT_XML</name>
        <default_value />
        <description>eCH-0252-v1 XML-Datei (voteBaseDelivery)</description>
      </parameter>
      <parameter>
        <name>OUTPUT_DIR</name>
        <default_value />
        <description>Bestehender Ausgabeordner ausserhalb des Checkouts</description>
      </parameter>
    </parameters>
  </info>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <xloc>70</xloc>
      <yloc>35</yloc>
      <width>1250</width>
      <height>75</height>
      <note>eCH-0252 v1 / voteBaseDelivery. Lieferkopf und alle Resultate werden vor der CSV-Ausgabe geprueft.
Nur CH/CT-Geschaefte werden exportiert; Gemeinde-Auszaehlkreise bleiben erhalten.
Standard-Transforms; INPUT_XML und OUTPUT_DIR bleiben die Launcher-Parameter.</note>
      <fontsize>10</fontsize>
      <fontname>Sans</fontname>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>255</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>255</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>224</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>150</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>150</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>150</bordercolorblue>
    </notepad>
    <notepad>
      <xloc>70</xloc>
      <yloc>760</yloc>
      <width>1250</width>
      <height>75</height>
      <note>Typ 1/2: Ja und Nein. Typ 3: Hauptvorlage und Gegenvorschlag; jeweils andere Stimmenfelder sind echte numerische NULLs.
Optionale Werte bleiben leer. Kreuzklassifikationen werden nicht als Einzelklassifikationen aufsummiert.
Sort Rows puffert den gesamten Strom. Text File Output oeffnet erst mit der ersten validierten Ausgabezeile.</note>
      <fontsize>10</fontsize>
      <fontname>Sans</fontname>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>255</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>255</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>224</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>150</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>150</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>150</bordercolorblue>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
  <order>
    <hop>
      <from>Parameter</from>
      <to>Lieferkopf lesen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Lieferkopf lesen</from>
      <to>Lieferung pruefen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Lieferung pruefen</from>
      <to>Datum typisieren</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Datum typisieren</from>
      <to>Bund-ID-Warnung notwendig</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Bund-ID-Warnung notwendig</from>
      <to>Bund-ID-Warnung</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Bund-ID-Warnung notwendig</from>
      <to>Gemeinderesultate lesen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Bund-ID-Warnung</from>
      <to>Gemeinderesultate lesen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Gemeinderesultate lesen</from>
      <to>Resultatfelder pruefen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Resultatfelder pruefen</from>
      <to>Zahlen und Zeitstempel typisieren</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Zahlen und Zeitstempel typisieren</from>
      <to>Pruefwert Null</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Pruefwert Null</from>
      <to>Geschaeftsgruppe und Pruefwert</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Geschaeftsgruppe und Pruefwert</from>
      <to>Stimmensummen berechnen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stimmensummen berechnen</from>
      <to>Stimmensummen pruefen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stimmensummen pruefen</from>
      <to>Nur Bund und Kanton</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Nur Bund und Kanton</from>
      <to>Ebene benennen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Nur Bund und Kanton</from>
      <to>Gemeindeabstimmungen verwerfen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Ebene benennen</from>
      <to>Geschaeftstyp benennen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Geschaeftstyp benennen</from>
      <to>Auszaehlstatus benennen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Auszaehlstatus benennen</from>
      <to>Dateiname bilden</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Dateiname bilden</from>
      <to>Stimmen zuordnen</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stimmen zuordnen</from>
      <to>Ja-Nein-Spalten</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Ja-Nein-Spalten</from>
      <to>Ja-Nein-NULLs</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Ja-Nein-NULLs</from>
      <to>Ja-Nein-Schema</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stimmen zuordnen</from>
      <to>Stichfrage-Spalten</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stichfrage-Spalten</from>
      <to>Stichfrage-NULLs</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stichfrage-NULLs</from>
      <to>Stichfrage-Schema</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stimmen zuordnen</from>
      <to>Unbekannter Geschaeftstyp</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Ja-Nein-Schema</from>
      <to>Resultate sortieren</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Stichfrage-Schema</from>
      <to>Resultate sortieren</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
    <hop>
      <from>Resultate sortieren</from>
      <to>CSV schreiben</to>
      <enabled>Y</enabled>
    </hop>
  </order>
  <transform>
    <name>Parameter</name>
    <type>GetVariable</type>
    <description />
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning>
      <method>none</method>
    </partitioning>
    <GUI>
      <xloc>100</xloc>
      <yloc>150</yloc>
    </GUI>
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>input_file</name>
        <variable>${INPUT_XML}</variable>
        <type>String</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>none</trim_type>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>output_prefix</name>
        <variable>${OUTPUT_DIR}/abstimmungsresultate_</variable>
        <type>String</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>none</trim_type>
      </field>
    </fields>
  </transform>
  <transform>
    <name>Lieferkopf lesen</name>
    <type>getXMLData</type>
    <description>Praefixunabhaengige XPath-Ausdruecke mit expliziten Namespace-URIs; keine Wiederholung fehlender Werte.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning>
      <method>none</method>
    </partitioning>
    <GUI>
      <xloc>290</xloc>
      <yloc>150</yloc>
    </GUI>
    <include>N</include>
    <rownum>N</rownum>
    <addresultfile>N</addresultfile>
    <namespaceaware>N</namespaceaware>
    <ignorecomments>Y</ignorecomments>
    <readurl>N</readurl>
    <validating>N</validating>
    <usetoken>N</usetoken>
    <IsIgnoreEmptyFile>N</IsIgnoreEmptyFile>
    <doNotFailIfNoFile>N</doNotFailIfNoFile>
    <encoding>UTF-8</encoding>
    <limit>0</limit>
    <loopxpath>/*</loopxpath>
    <IsInFields>Y</IsInFields>
    <IsAFile>Y</IsAFile>
    <XmlField>input_file</XmlField>
    <prunePath />
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>lieferung_id</name>
        <xpath>*[local-name()='deliveryHeader' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='messageId' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0058/5']</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>lieferung_zeitpunkt</name>
        <xpath>*[local-name()='deliveryHeader' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='messageDate' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0058/5']</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>testlieferung</name>
        <xpath>*[local-name()='deliveryHeader' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='testDeliveryFlag' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0058/5']</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>root_namespace</name>
        <xpath>namespace-uri(.)</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>root_element</name>
        <xpath>local-name(.)</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>base_count</name>
        <xpath>count(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>Integer</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>abstimmungstag</name>
        <xpath>*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='pollingDay' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>geschaeftsanzahl</name>
        <xpath>*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='numberOfEntries' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>geschaeftsanzahl_stimmt</name>
        <xpath>count(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']) = number(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='numberOfEntries' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>resultatanzahl</name>
        <xpath>count(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircleInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>Integer</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>geschaeft_ids_eindeutig</name>
        <xpath>not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteIdentification' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][. = preceding::*[local-name()='voteIdentification' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>hauptgeschaeft_verweise_gueltig</name>
        <xpath>not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='mainVoteIdentification' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][not(. = ../../../*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][*[local-name()='voteSubType' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']='1']/*[local-name()='voteIdentification' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']) or . = ../*[local-name()='voteIdentification' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']]) and not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][(*[local-name()='voteSubType' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']='2' or *[local-name()='voteSubType' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']='3') and not(*[local-name()='mainVoteIdentification' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'])])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>gemeindeschluessel_eindeutig</name>
        <xpath>not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircleInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircle' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircleId' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][. = ../../preceding-sibling::*[local-name()='countingCircleInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircle' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircleId' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>geschaeftsdaten_stimmen</name>
        <xpath>not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][not(*[local-name()='pollingDay' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'])]) and not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='pollingDay' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][. != ../../../*[local-name()='pollingDay' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>struktur_gueltig</name>
        <xpath>not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][count(*[local-name()='vote' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']) != 1 or not(*[local-name()='countingCircleInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'])]) and not(*[local-name()='voteBaseDelivery' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='voteInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']/*[local-name()='countingCircleInfo' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1'][count(*[local-name()='countingCircle' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']) != 1 or count(*[local-name()='resultData' and namespace-uri()='http://www.ech.ch/xmlns/eCH-0252/1']) != 1])</xpath>
        <element_type>node</element_type>
        <result_type>valueof</result_type>
        <type>String</type>
        <format />
        <currency />
        <decimal>.</decimal>
        <group />
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <trim_type>both</trim_type>
        <repeat>N</repeat>
      </field>
      <field>
